    "Research verification and manual version handoff are agency-added methods.",
    "Unsupported algorithm, distribution, benchmark and revenue numbers are not adopted.",
    "Public fictional examples are not private client wins or outcome evidence.",
    "MIT software/templates notice retained; no third-party images or brand assets copied."
